[en.FOCUS_C07_TRADE_CONTACT_C09]
Contact Sire’s Hollow

[en.FOCUS_C07_TRADE_CONTACT_C09_desc]
The Western Equestria Trade Alliance has just been established, but we need more resources and markets, as well as a complete industrial structure, to compete with the Empire.\nHowever, the rising Sire’s Hollow is also vying to become the economic center of Equestria, and to some extent, we are in competition with them. We may need to establish contact with them in advance to gain an advantage in future competition and avoid unnecessary conflicts.

[en.FOCUS_C07_TRADE_CONTACT_C09_OPINION_MODIFIER]
Trade Contact

[zh.FOCUS_C07_TRADE_CONTACT_C09]
接触名流谷

[zh.FOCUS_C07_TRADE_CONTACT_C09_desc]
西小马国贸易同盟初步建立，我们需要更多的资源和市场，以及完整的产业结构，才能和帝国分庭抗礼。\n但是，新兴的名流谷也在争取成为小马利亚的经济中心，一定程度上和我们构成了竞争关系。我们也许应该提前和他们建立联系，以便在未来的竞争中占据优势，并且避免不必要的冲突。

[zh.FOCUS_C07_TRADE_CONTACT_C09_OPINION_MODIFIER]
贸易接触

